// ATT&CK: lateral-movement, stealth
// Description: Detects the execution of PowerShell with a specific flag sequence that is used by the Wmiexec
//   script
// False positives:
//   - Unlikely
// References:
//   - https://github.com/fortra/impacket/blob/f4b848fa27654ca95bc0f4c73dbba8b9c2c9f30a/examples/wmiexec.py
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/ccbb0369507f796db0b0ae6854c8a2be471b9d84/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_hktl_wmiexec_default_powershell.yml
